``xia2.ssx``/``xia2.ssx_reduce``: Add a ``series_repeat=`` option, which generalises ``dose_series_repeat=``. It can be given as an integer, the size of the repeat, in which case the groups are named ``group_0``, ``group_1``, ... (matching ``dials.split_still_data``), or as a list of names for the groups, e.g. ``series_repeat=first,second,last``, in which case the number of names defines the size of the repeat and the names are used for the merged output files. A name may be repeated, in which case each occurrence is numbered in order, i.e. ``series_repeat=dose,dose,apo`` gives ``dose_1``, ``dose_2`` and ``apo``.
